1
00:00:02,585 --> 00:00:05,004
Johar, I am Kshetrabasi Juanga.

2
00:00:06,172 --> 00:00:07,465
Panchayat Budhakhaman...

3
00:00:07,966 --> 00:00:09,259
Block Harichandanpur.

4
00:00:09,718 --> 00:00:12,137
District - Keonjhar, State - Odisha.

5
00:00:13,221 --> 00:00:15,223
My caste (tribe) is Juang.

6
00:00:15,473 --> 00:00:16,599
My mother tongue is Juang.

7
00:00:17,726 --> 00:00:21,271
And I teach in a school.

8
00:00:22,105 --> 00:00:26,776
So that Juang students learn Juang

9
00:00:26,776 --> 00:00:30,280
as well as the Odia language

10
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:35,660
And, so, I have a request for everyone

11
00:00:36,202 --> 00:00:37,829
that Juang language,

12
00:00:37,829 --> 00:00:40,582
in our village and neighbourhood—...

13
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:43,251
wherever they are, they should speak.

14
00:00:43,418 --> 00:00:45,128
Then we will develop our community and language.
